menu "HAL Network"

config RH_NET
    bool "Enable network interface and sockets"
    default n
    help
      The network contract: an interface brought up by a platform, and sockets
      opened over it. Middleware that speaks MQTT, HTTP or a websocket selects
      it; a platform implements it over esp_netif, cyw43_arch and LwIP, or POSIX.

endmenu
